---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const pageTitle = "Piper Inns Hall";
---
<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <div style="max-width: 700px; text-align: left;">
    <p>
      Interested in <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Systems_programming">systems programming</a> and developer tooling.
      Working primarily in <a href="https://www.rust-lang.org/">Rust</a> for low-level systems,
      <a href="https://www.lua.org/">Lua</a> for developer tooling, and Java. Seeing code I've
      written help real people keeps me building. Based in <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Wellington/@-41.2525845,174.5894518,50686m/data=!3m2!1e3!4b1!4m6!3m5!1s0x6d38b1fc49e974cb:0xa00ef63a213b470!8m2!3d-41.2923814!4d174.7787463!16zL20vMDg1M2c?entry=ttu&g_ep=EgoyMDI1MTIwMi4wIKXMDSoASAFQAw%3D%3D">Wellington, New Zealand</a>. I'm always looking to understand systems from the
      ground up. Feel free to reach me via <a href="mailto:piper.innshall@gmail.com">piper.innshall@gmail.com</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

